<title>FRANCE: RALLYING-LEADING TOUR OF CORSICA FINAL PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING TOUR OF CORSICA FINAL PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AJACCIO, Corsica 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final placings in</p>
<p>the Tour of Corsica world championship rally after 18 timed</p>
<p>stages on Wednesday :</p>
<p>1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza  4 hours 31 minutes 08</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort		4:31:16</p>
<p> 3. Gilles Panizzi (France) Peugeot 306	   4:31:46</p>
